@startuml Proxy
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
title Proxy — Business example (C#)

interface ICustomerProfileService {
  + GetProfile(caller : Caller, customerId : string) : CustomerProfile
}
note top of ICustomerProfileService : Subject

class RemoteCustomerProfileService {
  - _backendCalls : int
  + GetProfile(caller : Caller, customerId : string) : CustomerProfile
  + BackendCalls : int
}
note bottom of RemoteCustomerProfileService : RealSubject

class AuthorizationProxy {
  - _inner : ICustomerProfileService
  - _policy : IAccessPolicy
  + GetProfile(caller : Caller, customerId : string) : CustomerProfile
}
note bottom of AuthorizationProxy : Proxy (protection)

class CachingProxy {
  - _inner : ICustomerProfileService
  - _ttl : TimeSpan
  - _cache : ConcurrentDictionary<string, Entry>
  + GetProfile(caller : Caller, customerId : string) : CustomerProfile
}
note bottom of CachingProxy : Proxy (caching)

interface IAccessPolicy {
  + CanRead(caller : Caller, customerId : string) : bool
}
class RegionalAccessPolicy {
  + CanRead(caller : Caller, customerId : string) : bool
}

class CustomerProfile <<record>> {
  + CustomerId : string
  + Name : string
  + Region : string
}
class Caller <<record>> {
  + UserId : string
  + Role : string
  + Region : string
}

class SolutionDemo {
  + {static} Run() : void
}
note right of SolutionDemo : Client

ICustomerProfileService <|.. RemoteCustomerProfileService
ICustomerProfileService <|.. AuthorizationProxy
ICustomerProfileService <|.. CachingProxy
AuthorizationProxy o--> ICustomerProfileService : _inner
CachingProxy o--> ICustomerProfileService : _inner
AuthorizationProxy --> IAccessPolicy : _policy
IAccessPolicy <|.. RegionalAccessPolicy
ICustomerProfileService ..> CustomerProfile
ICustomerProfileService ..> Caller
SolutionDemo ..> ICustomerProfileService

@enduml
